    videoId,
    { $inc: { views: 1 } },
    { returnDocument: "after" }
).populate("owner", "username fullName avatar")
```
Used `$inc` specifically instead of a read-then-write pattern to avoid a race condition if multiple requests hit the same video concurrently.

