### 22. Feature addition: video owners can delete (not edit) any comment on their own video

**What:** Extended `deleteComment` so that in addition to a comment's author being able to delete their own comment, the *video's owner* can also delete any comment on their own video — standard moderation capability on real video platforms. Editing intentionally stays restricted to the comment's author only; only deletion was extended.

